OL,3,GNorth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FA dry and
OL,6,Fbright end to the day with plenty of
OL,7,Fevening sunshine. This leading to a
OL,8,Fdry and clear night. Temperatures will
OL,9,Fdrop quickly to low single figures in
OL,10,Frural and sheltered spots. Grass frost
OL,11,Flikely.
OL,12,
OL,13,CThursday:FHazy sunny spells through
OL,14,Fmuch of Thursday and staying dry for
OL,15,Fall, some cloud developing over
OL,16,Fnorthern parts later. Light winds with
OL,17,Ftemperatures around average for the
OL,18,Ftime of year.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
