OL,3,GNorth West
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Friday to Sunday:FCloud
OL,6,Fand rain at times Friday turning drier
OL,7,Fand brighter later. Remaining settled
OL,8,Fthrough the weekend with variable
OL,9,Fcloud and bright of sunny spells.
OL,10,FTemperatures near or slightly above
OL,11,Faverage.
